<!--
  Hub studio · `/studio/skills` — the skill list.

  Composes the `@ship/skills` pack's <ship-skill-list>, which reads
  `ship.skills.list()` (Connect SDK LiveSource) and renders the
  registered skills grouped by SkillScopeTag (project/user/library).
  Empty/loading/error states are first-class; no BACKEND-GAP — the
  Connect op exists (`ship-sdk.ts:211`).

  The route is a thin composition — chrome is the root layout
  (`routes/_layout.sui` → `<ship-app-chrome>`), the page body is the
  pack component. No per-page bindings; the composite owns the data
  story.
-->
<main class="studio-skills">
  <ship-skill-list></ship-skill-list>
</main>
